{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"储能","country":"乌兹别克斯坦","country_iso":"UZB","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:02:31.762698","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"UZB-ES-0008","ldc":"No","location":"塔什干州","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"乌兹别克斯坦塔什干州奇尔储能电站","project_name_en":"Uzbekistan Tashkent Region Chirchiq Energy Storage Station","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"建筑集团","content":"近日，中国能建建筑集团和安徽院联营体中标乌兹别克斯坦塔什干州奇尔储能电站、乌兹别克斯坦塔什干州亚多储能电站两个储能电站项目。\n乌兹别克斯坦塔什干州奇尔储能电站位于塔什干州Chirchiq镇，距离市中心约50公里处，场址区域面积约为5公顷，厂址区域为草场区域，地势存在一定坡度。\n乌兹别克斯坦塔什干州亚多储能电站位于塔什干州olmaliq镇，距离市中心约70公里，场址区域面积约为5公顷，地势整体平坦。\n两个项目均采用电化学储能磷酸铁锂电芯，配置100兆瓦/200兆瓦时储能系统（一次性超配至约260兆瓦时）。根据乌兹别克斯坦能源部要求，各自新建1座220千伏升压站。奇尔项目接入Chirchiq变电站，外送线路约4.5千米。亚多项目采用π接至现有线路，外送线路约1.5千米。两个项目预计将于12月底前开工，2025年9月完工。项目的建成，有利于当地清洁能源的高效利用，可有效提高当地电网的安全稳定性。","content_sha256":"0b12f1168cdd4e7166d92eae36e7f1027ff854aab6f320bf8745696034a9e775","id":5356,"publish_date":"2024-12-20 18:09:03","title":"中国能建联营体中标乌兹别克斯坦塔什干州奇尔储能电站、亚多储能电站","title_sha256":"3067321c685a87b3d29103747ba3936b2b0794687f1f122d93854078f470487d","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/76502.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"UZB-ES-0008","capacity_details":"BESS: 100MW/200MWh (超配至约260MWh)","capacity_mw":100.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"100","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:02:31.763329","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"UZB-ES-0008-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.ceec.net.cn/art/2024/12/20/art_11019_2533961.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"乌兹别克斯坦能源部","p